  "roar_of_love.pack.desc": "Roar of Love - bilibili: 佳佳不好",
  "roar_of_love.readme.folder": "Roar of Love audio folder (mod by bilibili: JiaJiaBuHao)\nDrop .zip packs here; press L (or F7) in game to open the audio settings and toggle packs.\n\n[Pack layout]\n  minecraft/hurt/      hurt1.ogg ~ hurt9.ogg\n  minecraft/tnt/       fuse.ogg\n  minecraft/bow/       bow.ogg\n  minecraft/anvil/     anvil_land.ogg, anvil_use.ogg\n  minecraft/xp/        orb.ogg, levelup.ogg\n  minecraft/break/     break.ogg\n  minecraft/lava/      fizz.ogg\n  roar of love/<category>/   action sounds (dryimpacts, motions, retract, shots, wet, wetimpacts)\n  roar of love/calls/        begin1.ogg ~ begin10.ogg, end.ogg (general moans)\n  roar of love/calls/self/   begin1~10, end (masturbation)\n  roar of love/calls/oral/   begin1~10, end (oral)\n\n[Subtitle files] Put a .txt here, then pick it in Subtitle Settings - Load custom lines.\nFormat: one line per category, like  lust: line1/line2  (lust/anim/peak/self/oral).\n\nAfter editing, click Rescan or rejoin the world.",
  "roar_of_love.readme.template": "Roar of Love pack template (mod by bilibili: JiaJiaBuHao)\nPut your .ogg files into the matching folders, repack as .zip and drop it into RoarOfLove_Audio,\nthen enable it in the in-game audio settings.\nFolders: minecraft/<group>/..., roar of love/<group>/*.ogg, roar of love/calls/begin1~10+end,\nplus calls/self/ and calls/oral/ for those groups.",
  "roar_of_love.readme.calls": "Put begin1.ogg ~ begin10.ogg and end.ogg here (a random begin each second during animation, end when it stops).\nSubfolders self/ and oral/ are the masturbation and oral groups.\n(mod by bilibili: JiaJiaBuHao)",

